00:06:28.570 --> 00:06:32.080
I have my product in
GitHub, and I want

00:06:32.080 --> 00:06:33.800
to implement the change, right?

00:06:33.800 --> 00:06:37.660
It seems that shooting
lasers to crocodiles

00:06:37.660 --> 00:06:40.520
