00:27:53.940 --> 00:27:57.630
It's sending the
metrics to Prometheus.

00:27:57.630 --> 00:28:02.970
So you get status codes,
you get response time.

00:28:02.970 --> 00:28:04.980
Those are the two metrics
I'm checking here.

00:28:04.980 --> 00:28:07.800
But you could see
lots more metrics,

00:28:07.800 --> 00:28:09.540
